  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Affiliate disclosure</nav><p class="eyebrow">Transparency</p><h1>Affiliate and partner disclosure</h1><p class="lead">Slickk's technology recommendations are independent. No listed vendor has approved Slickk as a partner or affiliate.</p></div></section>
  <div class="section container editorial"><aside><a href="/business-tools/">Browse tools</a><a href="/partners/">Program research</a></aside><article><section><h2>Current links</h2><p>Vendor links on this site currently lead to official information pages. They are not tracked affiliate links, and Slickk does not claim a commission from them. A listing does not mean endorsement or membership.</p></section><section><h2>If this changes</h2><p>If Slickk is approved and later uses a commission-bearing link, the recommendation will carry a nearby disclosure and a sponsored-link label. We will state any relationship and keep the editorial choice separate from the potential payment.</p></section><section><h2>Your choice</h2><p>You can visit a vendor directly and do not need to use a Slickk link. Compare pricing, availability and terms before purchasing. Slickk consulting fees, when agreed in writing, are separate from vendor charges.</p></section></article></div>
</Layout>
